{
    "title": "Housecall Pro",
    "description": "Housecall Pro is the #1 rated field service management platform built to help run & grow your home services business from the palm of your hand. Save hours a week by going paperless, so you can work on your business, not just for your business.\r\n\r\nScheduling and Dispatching\r\n\u2022 Edit your schedule from desktop or phone \r\n\u2022 Manage appointments with a drag & drop calendar\r\n\u2022 Set recurring jobs, assign teams, & schedule arrival windows\r\n\u2022 Send jobs straight to your techs\u2019 calendars\r\n\u2022 Update techs with automatic phone notifications \r\n\u2022 Improve communication with in-app messaging\r\n\u2022 Attach notes & photos while out in the field\r\n\r\nCustomer Communication\r\n\u2022 Deliver a 5-star experience\r\n\u2022 Send job status updates & on-my-way texts\r\n\u2022 Automatically send text and email reminders & confirmations\r\n\u2022 Request reviews from your best customers\r\n \r\nOnline Booking\r\n\u2022 Allow customers to book online through your website, Yelp, or Facebook\r\n\u2022 Customers can directly book your available time slots\r\n\r\nEstimates & Invoices\r\n\u2022 Create, update, & send invoices & estimates from your computer or phone\r\n\u2022 Automatically email estimates, invoices, & receipts\r\n\u2022 Customize line items & add services during the job\r\n\r\nPayment\r\n\u2022 Accept cash, checks, & debit/credit\r\n\u2022 Process credit cards quickly through the app\r\n\u2022 Send text invoices & let your customers pay via phone\r\n\u2022 Directly deposit funds into your bank account\r\n\u2022 Close bigger jobs with consumer financing\r\n\r\nMarketing\r\n\u2022 Send automatic reminder & thank-you emails\r\n\u2022 Deliver automated postcards right to customers\u2019 doorsteps\r\n\r\nGPS Time Tracking\r\n\u2022 See when your team\u2019s at the job site & avoid miscommunications\r\n\u2022 Track techs\u2019 locations & schedule them to the closest job\r\n\r\nQuickBooks Online Integration\r\n\u2022 Import job history, customers, & price list\r\n\u2022 Reconcile payments & invoices\r\n\u2022 Instantly sync job data into QBO\r\n\r\nAdvanced Reporting\r\n\u2022 Track key data points with customizable reporting widgets\r\n\u2022 Drive business insights & optimize marketing\r\n\r\nAdmin & Security\r\n\u2022 Automatically sync data to your secure cloud\r\n\u2022 Allow admins to track job status from the office\r\n\u2022 Set employee permissions\r\n\u2022 Export customer data & job information at any time\r\n\r\nHousecall Pro has powered up! Want to learn how our new powerful features can help grow your business? Call us today at 858-842-5746!\r\n\r\nHousecall Pro Awards\r\n#1 Top PerformerField Service Management Solution by Capterra\r\nTop Category Leader for a Field Service Management App by GetApp (3 years in a row)\r\nRated Excellent on Trust Pilot for business services\r\n\r\nSubscription information:\r\nUpgrades to a paid subscription are through an in-app purchase. There are 3 different plans, starting at $49/month, that are flexible to your business\u2019 needs.\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://housecallpro.com/privacy\r\nTerms of use: https://housecallpro.com/terms",
